# J141: the pilot slice -- Forge against search-v2 on the same census games

20 slice games, 40 deck-games, 40 decks. Every interval is a deck-clustered percentile bootstrap (200 replicates, seed 1411). No verdict: any difference is a candidate until it holds on a fresh slice (D447 point 9). The decks are random draws from a band pool, so every rate is "in a random deck of this makeup", not in a built deck.

